% =====================================================================
% ALBUM I - CROWN FIRE SEASON - ABC NOTATION (hook melodies + chords)
% The Five-Album Collabo Cycle - led by CROWN FIRE (Fire Triad)
% =====================================================================
% All nine hook melodies below are ORIGINAL DESK COMPOSITIONS,
% composed by the desk for these lyric drafts - built to each
% hook lyric's rhythm and meter. They are composition drafts
% under the Flagpole, not transcriptions of any recording.
% Production spec (from the Gemini prompt pack): Detroit bounce
% trap, 144 BPM, A major, harmonica over the hooks, grand piano
% accents. Key signature A major: F, C and G sound sharp.
% Chords use the A-major family: A (I), F#m (vi), D (IV), E (V).
% Lyrics: docs/collabo-cycle/ALBUM-1.md (ghost drafts, stamped
% text pending the founder's red pen).
% Flagpole of Claim and Coinage: Johnathan 'Qasparr' Monroe,
% ARR, All Rights Reserved, Without Prejudice.
% =====================================================================

