%% Writing seat: SOL REY (Leo - IGNITE seat worn as a crown)
%% Formation: Qveen Bee SUNG hook (feature) - Sol Rey verses -
%% Ari Sparkz verse - Qasparr feature verse - anthem close.
%% Hook melody: anthem arc - rises from the dominant to the
%% tonic peak, "Crown Fire, Crown Fire" lands on a held tonic.
%% Hook lyric: "Strike the match, let the whole block know..."
"A"E E A A B c d2|"F#m"c c A F A B A2|"D"d d c A B c d2|"E"B B c d e2 B2|
"A"e e d c B c d2|"F#m"c B A F A B c2|"D"d d e f "E"e d B2|"A"e c A B A4|]

